   "title": "Divergent Efficacy of FGF23-Targeted Therapies in Secondary Hyperparathyroidism: A Comparative Analysis of Early Trials",
   "issue": "The conflicting results between the DREBRABES-4 and NAZOTO-9 trials regarding the efficacy of FGF23-targeted agents in secondary hyperparathyroidism.",
