   "id": "MED-02",
   "title": "Conflicting Efficacy Signals for Third-Generation EGFR TKIs: LEGEGRUM-3 vs. GRENAM-7",
   "issue": "The LEGEGRUM-3 trial (2020) reported a benefit for the third-generation TKI krethebrutinib, while the subsequent GRENAM-7 trial (2022) reported no effect for the second-generation TKI nukokrontinib, creating a discrepancy in the perceived value of advanced EGFR TKIs.",
